---
description: Core rules for this repo. Full details live in AGENTS.md.
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` at the repo root before any non-trivial task; it wins over this file.
Inside `examples/target/`, follow `examples/target/AGENTS.md` instead.

- Plan first: restate the task, list exact files, wait for approval past 3 files or on CI,
  dependency, or budget changes.
- Never invent SDK APIs or numbers. Verify in `node_modules/@cursor/sdk` type definitions;
  numbers come from committed `runs/*/summary.json`.
- Unit tests use fakes only. Never call the network or a real agent from tests.
- Never run `npm run pipeline` (it spends usage) unless the human asked for it.
- Never print or commit secrets. Never push.
- Gate: `npm run format:check && npm run typecheck && npm test`.
